From ad090527c626e9ebe397539a336383b77c8e44d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 15:29:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add "Po zmianie harmonogramu" section for non-standard
 internal schedules
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Recognize a one-time internal payment ("Płatność następuje jednorazowo")
  as a new paymentVariant internal_1, alongside existing internal_2/4/13.
- Add getScheduleChangeAnnexCards(): exposes Annex 29/29a for flexible or
  limit contracts paid directly to Tutlo (internal) in a schedule other
  than the standard 24 installments (jednorazowo, 2, 4 or 13 rat).
- Extend Annex 29/29a validators with a post_schedule_change mode that
  accepts flexible/limit + internal + internal_1/2/4/13. Calculation rules
  are unchanged (new price = current price - 1 or 2 installments).
- Wire a new "Po zmianie harmonogramu" section into index.html, mirroring
  the existing "Po zmianie formy płatności" section.
- Add regression tests, including a real jednorazowa payment fixture.
